{"4240040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "暗喻", "steam_appid": 4240040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Story Background】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rumor says that in the forest west of the school's rear gate, there lives a witch who can grant any wish. As a magic user who shares a bond with the witch, you too step into her abode. What exactly is the witch's secret? And what burden do you bear as a magic user? Open the Witch's Book! It will guide you to the very source of magic—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Gameplay】</strong> Players will take on the role of a  girl, navigating through the witch's castle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles:</strong> Search every room carefully and find the keys to reach the final area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding the Truth:</strong> Piece together the full story by reading books, diaries, and side stories scattered throughout the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices will lead to different conclusions of the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Game Features】</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre Fusion:</strong> A combination of RPG, exploration, puzzle-solving, and visual novel elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Atmosphere:</strong> Hidden behind the slightly dark and oppressive music and visuals is a story filled with &quot;love.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;May we all depict a story of magic and love.&quot;</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Story Background】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rumor says that in the forest west of the school's rear gate, there lives a witch who can grant any wish. As a magic user who sh